    {
      "subId": "7101210",
      "subQuestName": "Search for the Eye of the Storm",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710121001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710121001": {
            "id": "710121001",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Hmm? Did you have some business here, Traveler?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121002"
            ]
          },
          "710121002": {
            "id": "710121002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About the Eye of the Storm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121003"
            ]
          },
          "710121003": {
            "id": "710121003",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "An Eye of the Storm? I've been in this area this entire time, and I've never seen such a thing, except for that sudden huge gust wind earlier...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121004"
            ]
          },
          "710121004": {
            "id": "710121004",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "But I'm sure that it wasn't an Eye of the Storm. I would recognize one of those things anywhere.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121006",
              "710121008"
            ]
          },
          "710121006": {
            "id": "710121006",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Believe me, I wouldn't be able to forget something like that coming to interrupt my research even if I tried.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121009"
            ]
          },
          "710121009": {
            "id": "710121009",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "To be precise, I'm doing research together with a friend of mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121010"
            ]
          },
          "710121010": {
            "id": "710121010",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "He's also a scholar, and we went to Sumeru Akademiya together.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121011"
            ]
          },
          "710121011": {
            "id": "710121011",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "He became an archaeologist thereafter, traveling the world and doing surveys, while I continued my studies in the Akademiya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121012"
            ]
          },
          "710121012": {
            "id": "710121012",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "When he came to Mondstadt, he told me excitedly that he was surveying the Thousand Winds Temple.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121013"
            ]
          },
          "710121013": {
            "id": "710121013",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "He even said something like: \"Once I've uncovered the secrets of your homeland, you're the first person I'll tell.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121014"
            ]
          },
          "710121014": {
            "id": "710121014",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "I didn't hear from him afterwards. I asked someone to send Cyrus a letter, requesting that the Adventurers' Guild help me look for my friend's whereabouts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121015"
            ]
          },
          "710121015": {
            "id": "710121015",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "But there was no news of him at all, and so I discontinued my studies and hurried back here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121016"
            ]
          },
          "710121016": {
            "id": "710121016",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "But there's nothing here but a sundial, and there are no other clues...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121017"
            ]
          },
          "710121017": {
            "id": "710121017",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, there's a sundial on that island...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121018"
            ]
          },
          "710121018": {
            "id": "710121018",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "What? There's another sundial elsewhere that's identical to this one, and it's on an island?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121019"
            ]
          },
          "710121019": {
            "id": "710121019",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Oh, yes! Now I remember. I've actually seen that island sometimes, when the weather's clear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121020"
            ]
          },
          "710121020": {
            "id": "710121020",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Wait... You said that you found a notebook next to the sundial? Had my friend perhaps been there...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121021"
            ]
          },
          "710121021": {
            "id": "710121021",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Thank you. If I have the chance, I will head to that island to have a look. For now, however, I still have to figure this place out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121022"
            ]
          },
          "710121022": {
            "id": "710121022",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "I must continue my research. If you're interested, you can have a look at my research notes. I've left them over there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121023"
            ]
          },
          "710121023": {
            "id": "710121023",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Who knows? Perhaps there's something in there that might help you."
          },
          "710121008": {
            "id": "710121008",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Me? I'm doing a bit of research."
          }
        }
      }
    },
