    {
      "subId": "7101224",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Henry Morton",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710122401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710122401": {
            "id": "710122401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Where did this thing come from? It wasn't here before!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710122402"
            ]
          },
          "710122402": {
            "id": "710122402",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "How did you summon it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710122403"
            ]
          },
          "710122403": {
            "id": "710122403",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710122404"
            ]
          },
          "710122404": {
            "id": "710122404",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Ah, so that's \"time and wind...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710122405"
            ]
          },
          "710122405": {
            "id": "710122405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "So, there's another sundial exactly like this one on the island, am I right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710122406"
            ]
          },
          "710122406": {
            "id": "710122406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "And the method to solve its riddle is the same? Then there must be some link between these two sundials, and the two places they are located in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710122407"
            ]
          },
          "710122407": {
            "id": "710122407",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "I must find a way to get to that island, and quickly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710122408"
            ]
          },
          "710122408": {
            "id": "710122408",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Thank you, Traveler. Once I've made some preparations, I will look for you, and we shall visit that uninhabited island together."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101211",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710121101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710121101": {
            "id": "710121101",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Time and wind... Just what did he find?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121103",
              "710121107"
            ]
          },
          "710121103": {
            "id": "710121103",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "Oh, that's something that my friend mentioned in the very last letter that he sent me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121104"
            ]
          },
          "710121104": {
            "id": "710121104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "He said that \"time and wind\" hide one of Mondstadt's secrets.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121105"
            ]
          },
          "710121105": {
            "id": "710121105",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "However, I've never heard that phrase before, and I'm from around these parts. Who knows where he heard that..."
          },
          "710121107": {
            "id": "710121107",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "I did. Though I'm from Mondstadt, I've always been studying at the Sumeru Akademiya. I've probably spent more time there than I have in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121108"
            ]
          },
          "710121108": {
            "id": "710121108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "You want to know what happens in there? Well, it's not a secret, so... Hmm, how should I put it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121109"
            ]
          },
          "710121109": {
            "id": "710121109",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "They're a bunch of weird people. Hmm, perhaps that's too disrespectful... I guess they're \"people who make quite the impression?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710121110"
            ]
          },
          "710121110": {
            "id": "710121110",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Henry Morton",
            "text": "If you ever have the chance to go, you'll see what I mean. But just stick to having a look. You don't want to stay too long."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}